# ============================================================

# VIAFINDS AI OS — MASTER ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION

# ============================================================

#

# IMPORTANT:

# 1. This file is a STRUCTURE/template.

# 2. Empty values are intentional.

# 3. Never commit real secrets.

# 4. Keep private API keys server-side.

# 5. Do NOT use NEXT_PUBLIC_ for private API keys.

# 6. Provider availability/free limits change over time.

# 7. ENABLE_* flags allow the AI router to skip unavailable

# providers without breaking the automation system.

#

# Copy this file to:

#

# .env.local

#

# Then add your real credentials.

#

# ============================================================

# ============================================================

# 00 — APPLICATION

# ============================================================

